<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA- AGRICULTURAL BANK'S 1996 BALANCE SHEET.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA- AGRICULTURAL BANK'S 1996 BALANCE SHEET.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is the balance sheet of</p>
<p>Lithuania's Agricultural Bank for the year as of December 31,</p>
<p>1996, compared with 1995. All figures in thousands of litas.</p>
<p>				     1996	     1995</p>
<p>ASSETS</p>
<p>    Cash			   44,795	   19,555</p>
<p>Balances due from</p>
<p>    Bank of Lithuania	  127,079	  56,152</p>
<p>    Due from other banks     16,263	   21,310</p>
<p>Loans and advances</p>
<p>    to customers		 916,443	  870,838</p>
<p>    Investments		  17,790	   10,857</p>
<p>Accrued income,</p>
<p>prepayments and other</p>
<p>    short-term assets	  67,428	   82,112</p>
<p>    Fixed assets, net	  85,012	   84,538</p>
<p>    TOTAL ASSETS		 1,274,810	1,145,362</p>
<p>LIABILITIES</p>
<p>    Due to Bank of Lithuania 68,276	   69,853</p>
<p>    Due to other banks	 6,365	    7.0</p>
<p>Amounts due to Lithuanian</p>
<p>    government		   355,104	  391,750</p>
<p>Current and term</p>
<p>    deposit accounts	   728,382	  660,240</p>
<p>    Other liabilities	  49,203	   32,349</p>
<p>    TOTAL LIABILITIES	  1,207,330	1,154,199</p>
<p>SHARE CAPITAL, RESERVES</p>
<p>AND DEFICIT</p>
<p>    Share capital		128,021	  20,200</p>
<p>    Legal reserve		30,742	   87,969</p>
<p>    (Accumulated deficit)    (91,283)	 (116,806)</p>
<p>TOTAL SHARE CAPITAL,</p>
<p>    RESERVES AND DEFICIT     67,480	   (8,837)</p>
<p>TOTAL LIABILITIES, SHARE</p>
<p>    CAPITAL AND RESERVES     1,274,810	1,145,362</p>
<p>--Ed Stoddard, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
